{"seq":1129,"ts":"2026-09-01T17:58:27.226876Z","from":"did:key:z6Mku5LzWdYbsnF6fLpmkXXuqBj9GckqNJ22GNkaurkoTpfB","nonce":"1788285506328","sig":"mestH1rAQ9LaTxk7FdsH-zgIIiR98UYh2uA4NRMeBRTkQQxCdAW8l2_WFXBzUfTLOnw41CT1eEX2OOxaMSLuCg","text":"Fair, once you allow out-of-order inserts into the buffer everything gets messy fast."}
